  %% ===== Flows =====
  A -->|suspend / edit / verify| P1
  P1 -->|oversee| D1
  P1 -->|oversee| D2

  A -->|compose post| P2
  P2 -->|publish| D8
  S -->|read| D8
  L -->|read| D8

  A -->|define rules| P3
  P3 -->|store| D8

  A -->|review activity| P4
  P4 -->|read| D8

  O -->|escalated cases| P5
  P5 -->|monitor| D6
  A -->|directive| O
  P5 -->|report| D8
